      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sierraville%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Sierraville once had Sierra County’s only traffic signal—a flashing red light—removed after a crash in 2007 and replaced in 2008.",
